64.5771-25/499312338_1356200359785688_2006653803881372477_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jm8Phr0V5RAQ7kNvwGhlXSP&_nc_oc=AdqHgjOAWejq712ePbSZo4gjoSYHzSXXyG4BDFxBMENHCJAxaPcHVvh45IE3nusMy9A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTCpSIcOF9svWJebaevJSoN3sBMd_qhHGlfJdFNqk2l3w&oe=6B084BB1"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "860991350102555", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313063_860991353435888_2293964898643371154_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZ9ADz2lAJcQ7kNvwGfXkLQ&_nc_oc=Adq_GI5Nkfd0sS1fXeOgbUX5AOixLa9_lMnSauSK93qJoSr9V3es-ND-Bbv3yHNLtjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9jamkSWMfgGAEZUWsIlIskLrwXFky7uO-OnX2pBAhjA&oe=6B0840D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Coco Swinging", "keywords": ["Coco", "Tag", "Swinging", "CocoSwinging"], "long_description": "Step into Coco Swinging, the definitive VR experience for fans of physics-based locomotion. We\u2019ve taken the high-octane, movement-heavy gameplay you love and injected it with our own signature style. This isn\u2019t just another tag clone\u2014it\u2019s a living, breathing digital jungle where your skill, speed, and style define your legacy. Whether you are a competitive speedster looking to dominate the leaderboards or a socialite looking to hang out in the chillest lobbies, Coco Swinging offers a home for every kind of monke.", "short_description": "Coco Swinging is a fast-paced, physics-based VR fan game heavily inspired by Gorilla Loco. Swing, climb, and leap across custom environments using only your hands and arms. Featuring custom cosmetics, built-in features like long arms, and frequent community updates, it's the ultimate chaotic sandbox playground to hang out and play tag with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hOKxHe